# The menu bar's keyboard mode on SC0000 (docs/engine-re.md, "Native menu bar", "Keyboard mode"). An Alt tap selects
# ｹﾞｰﾑ without a dropdown, and the menu loop holds the game: a click on the game ends the loop and is eaten, and the
# next click advances. F10 enters the same way. In the loop, an access key opens its dropdown with the first item
# selected, and the arrows and Enter run ｵｰﾄﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ (0x9c65): turned on it ends the text wait at once, and Alt+M, A
# turns it off again, so the pair moves exactly one page. Left from ｹﾞｰﾑ is the window-menu position; Down opens the
# window menu on Restore (grayed in a window), Up wraps to Close, and Enter sends SC_CLOSE: the 終了 dialog.
# Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets, and compare the states:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py native start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py native run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-menu-keyboard.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=60  # page 1
settle

key alt                                 # an Alt tap: ｹﾞｰﾑ selected, the game holds
wait 0.5
click adv.next                          # ends the loop and is eaten
wait 1
expect top=SC0000@0x83f                 # still page 1
advance                                 # the next click advances
state                                   # page 2

key f10                                 # F10 selects ｹﾞｰﾑ too
key m                                   # ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ's access key: its dropdown, ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞｽｷｯﾌﾟ selected
key down
key down
key down                                # ｵｰﾄﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ
key enter                               # on: the text wait ends at once
key alt+m                               # Alt+M opens ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ again
key a                                   # and A turns ｵｰﾄﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ off before the next page's timer runs out
wait 2
settle
state                                   # one page on
wait 6
state                                   # and no further without input

key alt
key left                                # the window-menu position: nothing drawn
key down                                # the window menu, Restore (grayed) selected
key up                                  # wraps to Close
key enter                               # SC_CLOSE posts WM_CLOSE: the 終了 dialog
wait 1
dialogs
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ
wait 1
state
